{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"hellhound","model_identifier":"hellhound","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# hellhound\n\nHellhound (C2), walker, 1.0 m = 36 u at the shoulder, about 1.8 m (64 u) nose to rump plus tail.\n\nA demon dog: brick-red skin with glowing orange cracks (glow_crack cubes and painted cracks), a heavy undershot jaw with tusks, black spines down its back, black horn-like ears, black claws and burning yellow eyes. `fx_breath` sits in the mouth. Quadruped rig: root > body > rear, neck > head > jaw, tail_1 > tail_2, legs leg_upper/leg_lower/paw.\n\n- Cubes: 39 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -7.5..7.5, y 0.0..44.0, z -42.4..41.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 40 x 64 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2.6 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.46 | loop |  |\n| `attack_bite` | 1.2 | once | key 0.5 s: jaws snap shut after a crouch (0.25) and lunge (0.42) |\n| `breathe_fire` | 3.1 | once | draws breath 0.4; flame from fx_breath from 0.6 s to 2.6 s (2 s hold, small sweep); recovers by 3.1 |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | head low, snarling |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.5 | hold | legs give, rolls onto its side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 49.8 u/s (1.40 m/s), cycle 0.9 s, 44.8 u per cycle\n- `run`: 213.3 u/s (6.00 m/s), cycle 0.46 s, 98.1 u per cycle (gallop)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_bite`: key 0.5 s: jaws snap shut after a crouch (0.25) and lunge (0.42)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_breath` on `head` at (0, 32.25, -41.35)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crack_* are the lit cubes.\n- `fx_breath` (in the mouth, on the head bone): fire stream origin, points along -Z of the head.\n"},"description":"# hellhound\n\nHellhound (C2), walker, 1.0 m = 36 u at the shoulder, about 1.8 m (64 u) nose to rump plus tail.\n\nA demon dog: brick-red skin with glowing orange cracks (glow_crack cubes and painted cracks), a heavy undershot jaw with tusks, black spines down its back, black horn-like ears, black claws and burning yellow eyes. `fx_breath` sits in the mouth. Quadruped rig: root > body > rear, neck > head > jaw, tail_1 > tail_2, legs leg_upper/leg_lower/paw.\n\n- Cubes: 39 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -7.5..7.5, y 0.0..44.0, z -42.4..41.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 40 x 64 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2.6 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.46 | loop |  |\n| `attack_bite` | 1.2 | once | key 0.5 s: jaws snap shut after a crouch (0.25) and lunge (0.42) |\n| `breathe_fire` | 3.1 | once | draws breath 0.4; flame from fx_breath from 0.6 s to 2.6 s (2 s hold, small sweep); recovers by 3.1 |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | head low, snarling |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.5 | hold | legs give, rolls onto its side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 49.8 u/s (1.40 m/s), cycle 0.9 s, 44.8 u per cycle\n- `run`: 213.3 u/s (6.00 m/s), cycle 0.46 s, 98.1 u per cycle (gallop)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_bite`: key 0.5 s: jaws snap shut after a crouch (0.25) and lunge (0.42)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_breath` on `head` at (0, 32.25, -41.35)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crack_* are the lit cubes.\n- `fx_breath` (in the mouth, on the head bone): fire stream origin, points along -Z of the head.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.0,20.0,-22.0],"to":[7.0,36.0,2.2],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,28.0,-4.4],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[102,0,116.0,16.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[52,0,76.2,16.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,25,14.0,41.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[77,0,101.2,16.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,14.0,24.2],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[14,0,28.0,24.2],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e0437f58-87a3-50bc-8103-f6106a317662"},{"name":"waist","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6.0,22.0,2.2],"to":[6.0,35.5,22.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,28.0,2.2],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[40,41,52.0,54.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,41,19.8,54.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[52,41,64.0,54.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[20,41,39.8,54.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[28,0,40.0,19.8],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[40,0,52.0,19.8],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e502ae6d-0fec-563f-b2a9-44481b6b977e"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,29.0,-27.0],"to":[5.5,36.5,-19.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,33.0,-20.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[96,55,107.0,62.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[22,66,30.0,73.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[107,55,118.0,62.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[30,66,38.0,73.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,66,11.0,74.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[11,66,22.0,74.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"2c8b5449-359c-5f38-a25c-96dd96df66c0"},{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,30.05,-35.35],"to":[5.5,41.05,-25.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"i